            "review_text": "Happiness54749949264\n1 contribution\n0\nUnique high floor Com tam Sai Gon\nJul 2026 • Family\nThis is a beautiful little family business in district 1, on the 7th floor \nReally near famous Banh mi Huynh Hoa\nIt is a very clean and neat little restaurant \nThats specialises in broken rice dishes\nThe chop was very tender and nice and the whole meal was delicious\nThe owner is so friendly and nice, she can not speak English but always try to understand us.\nI came here first time with my friend, and second time with my parents (they need to experience this !!) \nWould highly recommend to come and see and taste for yourself 👍👍\nRead more\nWritten August 2, 2026",
