            "review_text": "Thanh Huyền N\n2 contributions\n0\nDelicious broken rice spots in District 1, Saigon\nJul 2026 • Business\nWas just wandering around the area and stumbled upon this place by chance. So glad I walked in!\nCơm Tấm 701 has this really cozy, homey vibe that instantly makes you feel comfortable. They mostly focus on traditional Saigon-style broken rice, but I was in the mood for something different that day, so I went for the Salmon with Lemon Sauce.\n The salmon was cooked just right and the tangy lemon sauce went so well with the rice.\nDefinitely adding this to my go-to list. I'll be back for sure!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten August 2, 2026",
