            "review_title": "Review at Cơm tấm 701 - Sườn bì chả chuẩn vị Sài Gòn",
            "review_text": "Garry M\n5 contributions\n0\nDelicious and excellent value\nJul 2026 • Couples\nThis restaurant specializes in com bi cha (broken rice). We tried two different kinds, both of which were absolutely delicious. Went very well with the kumquat tea. Don't be put off by the rather ofputting entrance, down a scooter parking alley and then a lift up to the 7th floor. Small and comfortable and nice to see the food being freshly cooked.\nRead more\nWritten July 20, 2026",
